+ *    messages fail once the AFE port runs, is taken down again (cx_port_down, the stop order of the earpiece's stage 11:
+ *    DISCONNECT_PORT, port off, interrupt clear, CHAN_CTRL remove, RECONFIG_NOW, AFE port stop) and tried again,
+ *    CX_TX_TRIES times in all; after the last one a channel that was acknowledged is used as it is. Only the overflow
